i040-wudifive-lun-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-040","source_id":"s-nanqishu-040-zilun-ws2272748","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zilun","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zilun:p001","quote":"巴陵王子倫字雲宗，世祖第十三子也。永明七年，爲持節、都督南豫司二州軍事、南中郎將、南豫州刺史。十年，遷北中郎將、南琅邪彭城二郡太守。鬱林卽位，以南彭城祿力優厚，奪子倫與中書舍人綦母珍之，更以南蘭陵代之。隆昌元年，遷散騎常侍、左將軍。延興元年，遣中書舍人茹法亮殺子倫，子倫正衣冠出受詔，曰：「鳥之將死，其鳴也哀；人之將死，其言也善。先朝昔滅劉氏，今日之事，理數固然。君是身家舊人，今銜此使，當由事不獲已。」法亮不敢荅而退。年十六。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zilun:p001:m0003","object_person_reference_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zilun:p001:r0009","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zilun:p001","surface":"世祖第十三子","start":9,"end":15}}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"齊武帝子次在本傳直書。","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanqishu-040-wudifive-mothers-ws2272748","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-040","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-wudifive-mothers","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-040-wudifive-mothers:p004:m0000"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanqishu-040-wudifive-mothers:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-040-wudifive-mothers:p004:m0000","mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-040-wudifive-mothers:p004:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-nanqishu-040-wudifive-mothers-ws2272748"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_v